{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmncustomtag"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNCustomTag"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the payload of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", one of the two untyped lanes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the tag model, and it is exactly the shape every tag had before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"model was typed: a name, an optional identifier, a flat list of parameters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a body of scoped symbols. Nothing here is interpreted — the parameters"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are whatever was written, in the order they were written, bound to nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is how GMN accommodates third-party extension: a name outside its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reserved vocabulary is not an error, but a custom tag that round-trips"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intact and realizes as a no-op, ready for a consumer or a downstream tool"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to give it meaning."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"What lands here","anchor":"What-lands-here","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A name outside GMN’s reserved vocabulary: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\bembel"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\splitChord"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\shortFermata"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\chord"},{"type":"text","text":", and anything a consumer invents. Nothing reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what was written to such a tag, so there is no schema to bind against and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing to model. It round-trips byte for byte and realizes as a no-op."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"What does not land here","anchor":"What-does-not-land-here","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A reserved name that failed to promote is "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this. The distinction is enforced by "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag\/init(ident:name:parameters:body:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which fails for a reserved name — so a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GMNCustomTag"},{"type":"text","text":" never carries a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reserved name, at any stage, and the case cannot be used as a general"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"escape hatch."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A Guido Music Notation tag whose name GMN does not reserve, carried in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its untyped, as-written form.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identif